OpenMers

This product includes design values derived from Medusa
(https://github.com/medusajs/medusa), packages/design-system/ui-preset
(@medusajs/ui-preset 2.22.6), licensed under the MIT License.

Derived files:
  - packages/tokens/src/tokens.json   (colour, shadow, typography, radius,
                                       animation and transition values)
  - packages/tokens/src/mapping.md    (Medusa token name -> OpenMers name)
  - packages/ui/src/theme.css         (generated from tokens.json)

Colour values are copied unchanged; some token names were changed to shadcn
names (see packages/tokens/src/mapping.md).

